# IP files (.xci) for qick_zcu216 
# Paths relative to the repository root
#
# IMPORTANT RULES: 
#   - Each .xci file must be located in a folder with the SAME name as the IP
#     Example: firmware/ip/clk_wiz/clk_wiz.xci   ← correct
#              firmware/ip/clk_wiz.xci             ← incorrect
#   - Only commit the .xci file, not the generated files (see .gitignore)
#
# Example:
# firmware/ip/zynq_ps/zynq_ps.xci
# firmware/ip/clk_wiz_0/clk_wiz_0.xci
# firmware/ip/axis_dwidth_converter_0/axis_dwidth_converter_0.xci
